<title>NETHERLANDS: CSS over-allotment option exercised.</title>
<headline>CSS over-allotment option exercised.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rabo Securities NV said on Monday it had exercised the over-allotment option on an additional 225,000 shares in Computer Services Solutions Holding NV which was floated on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange in April.</p>
<p>The deal increases the number of CSS shares to a total of 1,725,000. All shares were allocated to subscribers last month. The additional shares are sold by existing shareholders and will not cause a dilution of profits per share, Rabo Securities said.</p>
<p>The stock was floated at 17.00 guilders in April and rose to a year-high of 25.00 guilders on May 1. On Monday, the shares closed at 23.00 guilders, unchanged from Friday's closing level.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
